      "review_summary": "The PR adds Gateway active-run ids to session publications and uses them in Control UI chat reconciliation so stale completed-run rows do not switch the composer back from Send to Stop after terminal status clears.\n\nPR surface: Source +117, Tests +304, Docs +1. Total +422 across 19 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source/proof level: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/88033 reports the Send-to-Stop relapse after completion, current main lacks the toast-expiry reconcile hook, and this PR includes red current-main plus after-fix browser/Testbox evidence.",
